OL,3,GNEWSADiesel spillage closes M4
OL,4,Awestbound
OL,5,
OL,6,FA stretch of the M4 is expected to
OL,7,Fremain closed for the rest of the day
OL,8,Ffollowing a significant diesel spillage
OL,9,Facross the carriageway, National
OL,10,FHighways has said.
OL,12,FThe motorway has been closed westbound
OL,13,Fbetween junction 16 and 17 near
OL,14,FChippenham after an HGV collided with
OL,15,Fthe central reservation barrier shortly
OL,16,Fafter 02:00 BST on Thursday.
OL,18,FOne lane of the eastbound carriageway
OL,19,Fhas also been shut due to the "final
OL,20,Fposition of the HGV".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
