OL,3,GNEWSADiesel spillage closes M4
OL,4,Awestbound
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways said "extensive
OL,7,Frepairs" need to be carried out to 300m
OL,8,Fof central reservation safety barrier
OL,9,Fand almost 150m of road needs to be
OL,10,Fresurfaced.
